<title>USA: Procter &amp; Gamble Co Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Procter &amp; Gamble Co Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.26		    $1.07</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.18		     1.01</p>
<p> Net			881,000		  760,000</p>
<p> Revs		   8,771,000		8,587,000</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$4.00		    $3.52</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 3.74		     3.30</p>
<p> Net		    2,804,000		2,492,000</p>
<p> Revs		  26,816,000	     26,704,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Avg shares outstanding 681.4 million vs 686.5 million.</p>
<p>First Call estimate was $1.23.</p>
<p>Q3 oper income $1.4 billion vs $1.2 billion, and for nine months $4.5 billion vs $4.0 billion.</p>
